{"id": "DfSEAIEyYFn", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "19 November 2023 ki woh raat, jab trophy saamne thi aur haath khaali reh gaye 💔\n\nAhmedabad, 92,453 log, aur ek team jo lagataar 10 match jeet ke final tak aayi thi.\nRohit 47 pe the jab Travis Head ne peeche bhaagte hue dive maar ke catch pakad liya. Kohli 54 pe Cummins ki gend stumps pe kheench baithe, aur poora stadium chup ho gaya.\nAustralia 6 wicket se jeet gaya. Kohli ne cap se chehra dhak liya, Rohit bhari aankhon se maidan se chale gaye.\n\n🎵 Choo Lo · The Local Train (Aalas Ka Pedh)\n\nSend this to the fan who still can’t watch the highlights of 19 November 💙\n\nChoo Lo | The Local Train | Aalas Ka Pedh | World Cup 2023 final | India vs Australia | 19 November | Rohit Sharma | Virat Kohli | Ahmedabad | cricket heartbreak\n\n#ChooLo #TheLocalTrain #WorldCup2023", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793715001, "like_count": 126, "comment_count": 3, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2193627858695937a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.006, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPg2Ko8Fh9mU-80cmI0NGtktE_0WL97FCRg6vCDuIqj-QvXK9uJpMpNyb2J71VtgW4TWj7yD55iUf1GhLPI9EnpbQm8ewWNbvCesmk.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdoumqSaVx0UVQpzXOQq_TZyZltNYcEZI8FIuk5LM8apN5q72a8nKUyZOtoaGRaFDvTi7O_9ZyzlFJ6Z7hnSNVul&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=dNMwPTpgO1cQ7kNvwGljXeG&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=rHdTcqGKsQjreBBnTvSL5A&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQKE6ADjL6M40uZaifQGZPAxZrFPjjy4zfwc_pKFgLXkQ&oe=6AF42DEE", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.006, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5